I'm not sure what your intent is.  The point of the
nested evaluation is to start a whole new autodiff
on top of the current autodiff stack, evaluate it,
then pop it off the stack.  It doesn't make sense to
involve variables that are declared before start_nested()
is called --- think of it as forming a scope just like
in a program.

- Bob

