I'm with Andrew in thinking we should recommend running
multiple chains of ADVI.  This will allow users to diagnose
non-convergence of the final multivariate approximations.  Can
we come up with analytical versions of things like expected R-hat
for the final approximations?  Or could we compute things like
KL divergence of two multinormals easily?

- Bob

