I'm curious what other people think about this, as I think it's
the most contentious part of the proposal.

There are three locations (now is what it is now; proposed is what I proposed):

* Stan language usage (now "_log"; proposed remove)

  ld << cauchy_ld(y | mu, sigma);

* user-defined functions to be used as densities (now "_log"; proposed keep)

* Stan math lib suffixes (now "_log"; proposed keep)

- Bob

